# The cartridge itself -- copyrighted, not distributed. Supply your own
# legally-owned dump named exactly as below (or edit the .command scripts)
# to reproduce anything in this repo.
*.a78

# Generated disassembly -- fully reproducible from annotations.json + the
# ROM via the a7800-toolkit (see README.md). Not committed: 1MB+ and stale
# the moment annotations.json changes.
/src/
/build/

# Audio/video captures and renders -- large, derived from the cartridge's
# own copyrighted music/graphics, and reproducible from the .inp recordings
# plus the toolkit's capture tools.
*.wav
*.trk
*.log
/snap/

# Raw memory dumps -- contain copyrighted ROM/RAM bytes, reproducible from
# a recording + a probe script (see docs/FINDINGS.md for which probe made
# each one).
*.bin

# Local MAME config -- machine-specific, regenerated on first run.
/cfg/

# Derived analysis manifests -- reproducible from the ROM + recordings via
# tools/live-slots.lua, build_coverage.py, build_gallery.py. Not the primary
# record (annotations.json and docs/FINDINGS.md are); regenerate as needed.
bb-live-blocks.json
bb-live-manifest.json
live-slots.json

.DS_Store
